Package: toolbox
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/user/toolbox
Description: Browser start page with terminal aesthetic
 Toolbox is a minimal, offline-capable browser start page with a
 hacker/terminal aesthetic. It features a clock, search bar, quick
 links, RSS feeds, GitHub PR tracking, and a plugin system for
 custom tools.
 .
 Features:
  * Terminal green on black theme
  * Clock with timezone display
  * Configurable search engine
  * Quick links sidebar
  * RSS/Atom feed display
  * GitHub pull request tracking
  * Plugin system for custom tools
  * API proxy to avoid CORS issues
  * In-memory caching
